	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Certe silentium tuum attribui variis negotiis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tuis, adde et mercatui.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed bene est, quando intelligo <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>librum <persName ref="p8033">Bezae</persName> esse tibi redditum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Satis mature hunc <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>remiseris, ubi ipso fueris usus ac tuto poteris re<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>mittere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Caussae <persName ref="p20473">Ganthnerianae</persName> catastrophen, si qui<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>dem illa addi queat, cupide intelligere desidero.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Ego bene spero bonitate domini fretus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Facile is cum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>suo <persName>Franco</persName> confutabitur, qui rapsodus fuit ineptus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>citra iudicium et nullo cum fructu, imo detrimento <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>multa coacervans nec omnino a secta anabaptistarum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>alienus fuit imbutus et aliis sectis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Et mani<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>festum est, quae sint huius nostri seculi eruditorum hominum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>iudicia de hoc Franco.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Potior habenda est ratio veri<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>tatis quam omnium anabaptistarum, <persName>Francorum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><persName>Witilingorum</persName> et similium catenflianorum etc.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Re<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>mitto tibi literas d. <persName ref="p8057">Campelli</persName> et oro, ut ipsum meo no<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>mine salutes humanissime.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dominus concedat, ut <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>collegam consequare hunc virum pium, doctum et pacificum!</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Qua de re dudum scripsi ad d. <persName ref="p3958">Willium</persName> consulem, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quem etiam diligentissime nomine meo salutabis, tum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosium</persName> consulem, praefectum urbis, d. <persName ref="p1770">Carolum</persName>, d. <persName ref="p6130">Pontisellam</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>d. <persName ref="p8186">Bonetum</persName> et alios nostros amicos.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas ad d. <persName ref="p4037">Zanchum</persName> per <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>primum quemque tabellionem curabo perferri <placeName ref="l210">Heydelbergam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Falsa retulerunt coementarii d. <persName ref="p8057">Campello</persName> de <persName>Maximi<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>liano imperatore</persName>; is enim haeret adhuc <placeName ref="l471">Spyrae</placeName> soluturus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>inde comitiis finitis 4. huius mensis et rediturus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l396">Pragam</placeName> <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemiae</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Vana sunt, quae etiam retulere de <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>expeditione <placeName ref="l619">Bavari</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Accepi enim literas <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>datas 21. huius praeteriti mensis; sed ne gry quidem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 1. decembris 1570. <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>31. octobris ist das meer durch die wind uffgetriben, das <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>es mitt der fluͦt vil stett, land und lüth imm <placeName ref="l20">Niderland</placeName> by nacht über<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ylt und greusemlich alles verderpt hat.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l15">Antorff</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ist übel dardurch geschent.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Hat die stattmuren uff <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>60 schritt nidergerissen und inen unsaglichen schaden <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>gethan.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Ist ettlich myl für <placeName ref="l15">Antorff</placeName> uß gerunnen.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><placeName>Bergen</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>die statt, hat's verderpt, <placeName>Armüyr</placeName>, die schön statt, gar <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>verfuͤrt, das wenig lüth darvon kummen.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">In <placeName ref="l2012">Seeland</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>hat's 4 stett dahin genommen, darunder ouch <placeName ref="l2457">Rotter<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>dam</placeName><note type="margin">a.R.: Romerschwan.</note>, sunst by 70 stett, fläcken und dörffer, und <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ist undergangen lüth, fäch, guͦt und was da xin.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Vil <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>tusend menschen söllend ertruncken sin.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de">Sol ein un<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>erhörter jamer sin.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Also schript man von <placeName ref="l15">Antorff</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>von <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName> und <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Ists nun halb war, so <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>ists frylich ein jomer, der uns leert, die ougen <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>uffthuͦn und uns rüsten.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">Dann es der gwüssen zeychen <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>eins <foreign xml:lang="la">Lucae 21.: "Erunt signa" etc.</foreign></s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">Und was joch die <placeName ref="l522">Venediger</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>dissimulierend, söllend sy <placeName ref="l2652">Cyprum</placeName> verloren <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>haben, und das arm volck darin zerhacket oder gefangen <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>hinwäg gfürt etc.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Premium inquisitionis receptae etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de">In grosser yl.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">H[einrychus] B[ullingerus]</persName><note type="margin">a.R.: HB</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8016">Tobiae <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Eglio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fideli ministro, sym<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>mystae et fratri dilecto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Dem h. pfarrer zuͦ S. Marti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
